# Freemium

- Free: **2 drafts**, full editor, share links, Print/PDF **with watermark**.
- Do not block Print on free. Show a gate: “В PDF будет метка free” → Печатать с меткой | Снять метку (Pro).
- Default paid offer is **Pro Lifetime — 2 490 ₽ разово**. Monthly **990 ₽/мес** is secondary.
- Pro unlocks: unlimited drafts + no watermark. Entitlement is stored in `localStorage` only after **server-verified** redeem (`POST /api/license/redeem`).
- Keep prices, offer ids, and mailto invoice helpers in `src/lib/plan.ts`. Do not hardcode a different limit or price.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
saveDraft(createProposal()); // even when 2 drafts already exist on free

// ✅ GOOD
if (!canCreateDraft()) return;
const next = saveDraft(createProposal());
```
